# Policy: Read-only analysis

## Allowed

- Read any file in the repository
- Run read-only or verify commands listed in the instruction
- Write findings to `loop/review-notes.md` or stdout per output-contract

## Forbidden

- Editing source files in this iteration (unless instruction says fix-only for listed blockers)
- Approving without running verify commands when they are specified

## Stop

- If verify cannot run, report `BLOCKED` with the exact command and error—not a silent pass.
